plaintext
* NMOS Transistor (Drain, Gate, Source)
M1 2 3 2 NMOS

* Resistor (Node 1, Node 2, Resistance)
RD 4 2 1k

* Voltage Source VDD (Positive, Negative, DC Value)
VDD 4 2 DC 5V

* Voltage Source Vin (Positive, Negative, DC Value)
Vin 3 2 DC 1V

* Assume NMOS model provided elsewhere
.model NMOS NMOS